    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "Earlier bail application (M.Cr.C.No.25807/2024) was dismissed as withdrawn with liberty to file afresh, vide order dated 27.06.2024 passed by co- ordinate Bench of this Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 1058,
      "end": 1233,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "M.Cr.C.No.25807/2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1084,
          "end": 1104
        },
        {
          "text": "27.06.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1179,
          "end": 1189
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1750521957874298
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "As per the case of prosecution, victim, aged around 18 years, submitted a hand-written complaint to SHO, P.S. Hazira, Gwalior on 02.06.2024 that Manoj (applicant) is her neighbour.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1234,
      "end": 1415,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "P.S. Hazira",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1340,
          "end": 1351
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1353,
          "end": 1360
        },
        {
          "text": "02.06.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1364,
          "end": 1374
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1380,
          "end": 1385
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1692216992378235
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "She is acquainted with Manoj since childhood.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1416,
      "end": 1461,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1439,
          "end": 1444
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18815991282463074
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "In year 2021, Manoj proposed to take her for a drive.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1462,
      "end": 1515,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1476,
          "end": 1481
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23091985285282135
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Manoj took 2 MCRC-28536-2024 her in his car to Shivpuri Link Road.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1516,
      "end": 1582,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1516,
          "end": 1521
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22596651315689087
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "He offered her cold drink.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1583,
      "end": 1609,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2507650852203369
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "After consuming cold drink, she went unconscious.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1610,
      "end": 1659,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2711830735206604
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Next day morning, around 8:00- 9:00, Manoj left her near Naveen Park.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1660,
      "end": 1729,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1697,
          "end": 1702
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2643719017505646
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "He threatened to disrepute her and told her to meet whenever he called.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1730,
      "end": 1801,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2589225471019745
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Due to fear of Manoj, she continued to meet Manoj.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1802,
      "end": 1852,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1817,
          "end": 1822
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1846,
          "end": 1851
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.268874853849411
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "On 26.05.2024, Manoj took her to a hotel and committed rape on her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1853,
      "end": 1920,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.05.2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1856,
          "end": 1866
        },
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1868,
          "end": 1873
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3216626048088074
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "When Manoj was escorting her to her home, her brother intercepted them and took her home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1921,
      "end": 2010,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manoj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1926,
          "end": 1931
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3314284086227417
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "She narrated the incident to her brother and father and came to report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2011,
      "end": 2082,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3223396837711334
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "On such allegations, Police Station- Hazira, District Gwalior (M.P.), registered FIR at Crime No.284 of 2024 for offence punishable under Sections 376, 376(2)(n), 506 of IPC and under Sections 3/4, 5L/6 of the Protection of Children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012 against applicant - Manoj.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2083,
      "end": 2373,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Police Station- Hazira",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2104,
          "end": 2126
        },
        {
          "text": "District Gwalior",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2128,
          "end": 2144
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 376",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2221,
          "end": 2233
        },
        {
          "text": "376(2)(n)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2235,
